      "text": "Function requirement\n\n- Book ticket \n- view parking lot\n- search for a parking lot \n\nNon functional \n\n- Strong consistency for booking tickets \n- High availability for viewing tickets \n- low latency search \n- scalability to handle surge due to long weekends and party events ",
