      "text": "Entities \n- Parking_venue\n- Tickets \n- Parking venue to Tickets : one to many mapping \n",
      "fontSize": 17.03385416666667,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entities \n- Parking_venue\n- Tickets \n- Parking venue to Tickets : one to many mapping \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "E-7VOEBUWyGjMf0bELwWS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2453.1250214550973,
      "y": 127.28448562444756,
      "width": 312.17669677734375,
      "height": 447.0677546165283,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 53914238,
      "version": 802,
      "versionNonce": 145473182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738100007106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Parking_venue\n-id\n-location\n-tickets []\n- parkingSeat []\n\nparkingSeat\n- id \n- parkingVenue \n- spotID \n- type {enum : bus, care, bike, ev ... }\n\n\nTickets \ncomposite -> -ticketId -parkingVenue \n\n-spotId\n-price\n-status \n\n",
      "fontSize": 17.031152556820125,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Parking_venue\n-id\n-location\n-tickets []\n- parkingSeat []\n\nparkingSeat\n- id \n- parkingVenue \n- spotID \n- type {enum : bus, care, bike, ev ... }\n\n\nTickets \ncomposite -> -ticketId -parkingVenue \n\n-spotId\n-price\n-status \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZoS44YwEpdCef34Gf3sVL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 351.44121170043945,
      "y": 397.78897596910645,
      "width": 822.8632869720459,
      "height": 581.2888235100602,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 656537378,
      "version": 1689,
      "versionNonce": 1450822106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738107631381,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nApi \n- search api for parking lots \n    - GET : search/parkingLots/{location}/{type} -> parkingLots, tickets [], location[] \n    - GET search/tickets/{parkinglotId} -> tickets []\n\n- tickets booking api \n\n   - POST : \n        booking/reserver \n        JWT - sessiontocken  \n        \n        :body {\n        {ticketID}\n        paymentDetails {Stripe or paypal}\n        }\n    \n   - POST : \n            booking/confirm\n            JWT : sessionTocken \n            \n            :body {\n            ticketId\n            status\n            }",
      "fontSize": 18.601242352321925,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nApi \n- search api for parking lots \n    - GET : search/parkingLots/{location}/{type} -> parkingLots, tickets [], location[] \n    - GET search/tickets/{parkinglotId} -> tickets []\n\n- tickets booking api \n\n   - POST : \n        booking/reserver \n        JWT - sessiontocken  \n        \n        :body {\n        {ticketID}\n        paymentDetails {Stripe or paypal}\n        }\n    \n   - POST : \n            booking/confirm\n            JWT : sessionTocken \n            \n            :body {\n            ticketId\n            status\n            }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ouSrWkW4LB4mEJXXZddib",
